  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">=====================================================================================<br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#f60\">Terrafirmacraft</span> 與 <span style=\"color:#f60\">Farmers Delight</span> 模組為本模組正常運作所必要</span></strong></span><br>=====================================================================================</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#00f;font-size:18px\">完全將 Farmers Delight 融入 TerrafirmaCraft 的世界。</span><br></span></strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/743/multi1.png\" width=\"1094\" height=\"597\"><br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">主要功能</span><br><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">使用 TFC 世界的資源作為 FD 的食譜（您可以在烹飪鍋中使用來自 TFC 的蔬菜、水果和肉類來進行料理）</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">每個 FD 食物的食物腐敗機制（食物會像 TFC 一樣過期）</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">為每個 FD 食物添加適當的營養成分（蔬菜、蛋白質、乳製品、穀物、水分）</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">無法使用已過期的食材（&nbsp;過期食物無法使用）</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">工具與組件的相容性</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">必須使用 TFC 的火爐來烹煮 FD 的鍋具中的食物<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/776/744/multi2.png\"><br><br>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>嘗試其他 TFC 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 模組<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-debark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/241/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"Debark TFC\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><strong style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/251/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corals-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/249/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-ore-washing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/250/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-more-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/252/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spindles-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/253/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-better-stone-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/261/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-metal-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/263/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-muskets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/262/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>",
